sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User / Browser
    participant C as SPA Client
    participant AS as Auth Server
    participant RS as Resource Server (API)

    U->>C: Clicks Login
    note over C: Generates random "code_verifier"
    note over C: Hashes to "code_challenge" (SHA256+Base64url)
    C->>AS: Authorization Request (client_id, code_challenge, code_challenge_method=S256)
    
    AS-->>U: Prompts for Credentials
    U->>AS: Enters Credentials
    
    AS->>C: Returns Authorization Code
    
    C->>AS: Token Request (Authorization Code, code_verifier)
    note over AS: Hashes received "code_verifier"
    note over AS: Compares hash with stored "code_challenge"
    
    AS->>C: Returns Access Token & ID Token
    
    C->>RS: API Request (Authorization: Bearer <Access Token>)
    RS->>RS: Validates JWT signature (RS256 via JWKS) and claims
    RS->>C: API Response
